WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.647 --> 00:00:10.088
Jin wanted to have a party.

2
00:00:10.108 --> 00:00:12.949
"Mom, can I have a slumber party?"

3
00:00:13.269 --> 00:00:14.790
she asked her mother one evening.

4
00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:16.410
"A slumber party?

5
00:00:16.711 --> 00:00:19.352
You mean invite some friends to sleep over at our house?"

6
00:00:19.712 --> 00:00:20.312
Mother said.

7
00:00:20.332 --> 00:00:22.133
"Yes. May I?

8
00:00:22.313 --> 00:00:24.774
Please?" Jin pleaded with her mom.

9
00:00:25.454 --> 00:00:29.596
The next day at school, Jin invited three of her friends to her slumber party.

10
00:00:30.748 --> 00:00:31.428
"When is it?"

11
00:00:31.648 --> 00:00:32.389
Rachel asked.

12
00:00:32.409 --> 00:00:33.829
"This Saturday.

13
00:00:34.169 --> 00:00:36.430
Come around four o'clock," Jin said.

14
00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:37.950
"What should we bring?"

15
00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:39.170
Mandy asked.

16
00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:41.391
"Your toothbrush and pajamas."

17
00:00:42.171 --> 00:00:47.433
On the day of the slumber party, Jin was busy cleaning her room when her brother Min opened

18
00:00:47.473 --> 00:00:47.833
the door.

19
00:00:47.853 --> 00:00:50.014
"How many girls are coming?"

20
00:00:50.474 --> 00:00:50.974
he asked.

21
00:00:50.994 --> 00:00:53.755
"None of your business!

22
00:00:54.135 --> 00:00:54.895
Go away!"

23
00:00:55.575 --> 00:00:58.536
Min was a troublemaker, but Jin was not worried.

24
00:00:59.236 --> 00:01:02.297
No one would ruin her party─not even her brother!

25
00:01:02.918 --> 00:01:06.299
At four o'clock, Rachel, Mandy, and Fran arrived at Jin's house.

26
00:01:06.319 --> 00:01:10.281
"We're going to have so much fun!"

27
00:01:10.661 --> 00:01:12.242
The girls giggled excitedly.

28
00:01:12.262 --> 00:01:14.462
"What should we do first?"

29
00:01:15.023 --> 00:01:15.763
Fran asked.

30
00:01:16.383 --> 00:01:17.604
"Let's make cookies!"

31
00:01:18.164 --> 00:01:19.144
Mandy suggested.

32
00:01:22.286 --> 00:01:24.147
The girls made chocolate chip cookies.

33
00:01:24.827 --> 00:01:27.308
When they were ready, Min rushed into the kitchen.

34
00:01:27.968 --> 00:01:30.549
"Cookies! My favorite!"

35
00:01:30.829 --> 00:01:32.630
he yelled and grabbed some cookies.

36
00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:34.111
"Get out!

37
00:01:34.431 --> 00:01:35.911
Those are our cookies!"

38
00:01:36.391 --> 00:01:37.092
Jin shouted.

39
00:01:37.752 --> 00:01:40.553
Min took some more cookies and ran out of the kitchen.

40
00:01:41.193 --> 00:01:43.914
Jin had rented some videos to watch with her friends.

41
00:01:45.375 --> 00:01:48.916
The girls took their cookies to the living room and sat down to watch.

42
00:01:49.577 --> 00:01:51.617
The first movie was really exciting.

43
00:01:51.637 --> 00:01:54.479
"Oh, what's going to happen next?"

44
00:01:54.979 --> 00:01:56.519
Mandy said, covering her mouth.

45
00:01:56.539 --> 00:02:02.306
"Shh! This is the most important part Fran's eyes got big.

46
00:02:02.847 --> 00:02:05.208
Suddenly the channel switched to a soccer game.

47
00:02:05.228 --> 00:02:06.889
"What happened?"

48
00:02:07.329 --> 00:02:08.390
the girls cried out.

49
00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:09.771
Jin looked around.

50
00:02:11.151 --> 00:02:14.493
There, behind the couch, was Min holding the remote control.

51
00:02:14.513 --> 00:02:17.275
"Min!" Jin shouted loudly.

52
00:02:17.855 --> 00:02:20.437
She went and told her parents everything Min had done.

53
00:02:20.457 --> 00:02:26.300
"Min, you promised not to bother your sister and her friends," Father reminded him sternly.

54
00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:29.181
"Don't even go near Jin's room!

55
00:02:29.561 --> 00:02:30.641
Do you understand?"

56
00:02:31.141 --> 00:02:31.721
Mother said.

57
00:02:31.741 --> 00:02:33.902
"Stay away from us!"

58
00:02:34.462 --> 00:02:35.302
Jin yelled at him.

59
00:02:37.383 --> 00:02:41.564
She took some pizza from the kitchen, and the girls all went up to her room to eat

60
00:02:41.624 --> 00:02:46.386
it. After they ate the pizza, the four friends decided to have some fun.

61
00:02:46.406 --> 00:02:48.406
"Let me do your hair!"

62
00:02:48.926 --> 00:02:49.567
Rachel said.

63
00:02:50.147 --> 00:02:52.287
But Mandy had an even better idea.

64
00:02:52.307 --> 00:02:54.248
"Look what I brought!"

65
00:02:54.992 --> 00:02:57.054
"Makeup!" screamed the girls.

66
00:02:57.074 --> 00:02:58.955
"It's my sister's.

67
00:02:59.395 --> 00:03:01.296
I borrowed it for tonight!"

68
00:03:02.097 --> 00:03:02.917
Mandy giggled.

69
00:03:04.979 --> 00:03:09.562
In no time at all, all the girls had fancy hairstyles and glamorous makeup.

70
00:03:10.082 --> 00:03:11.583
"You look great!"

71
00:03:12.084 --> 00:03:13.725
Fran admired Rachel's eyes.

72
00:03:14.405 --> 00:03:16.066
"You look like Britney Spears!"

73
00:03:16.607 --> 00:03:17.747
Jin said to Mandy.

74
00:03:18.348 --> 00:03:21.190
Suddenly the girls all stopped and looked at each other.

75
00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:23.191
"Let's make a band!"

76
00:03:23.651 --> 00:03:24.232
they shouted.

77
00:03:24.872 --> 00:03:27.473
The girls danced and sang their favorite songs.

78
00:03:30.254 --> 00:03:34.176
They were having so much fun that it was past ten o'clock before they knew it.

79
00:03:34.777 --> 00:03:39.218
The friends changed into their pajamas, and Jin's parents came up to say good night.

80
00:03:39.238 --> 00:03:42.840
"Don't stay up too late, girls," Jin's father said.

81
00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:47.262
"If you get hungry, there's some cake in the kitchen," Mother said.

82
00:03:47.282 --> 00:03:48.443
"Thank you.

83
00:03:48.663 --> 00:03:49.423
Good night!"

84
00:03:49.923 --> 00:03:50.984
the girls called out.

85
00:03:52.784 --> 00:03:57.006
After Jin's parents closed the door to the room, Fran turned to the others.

86
00:03:57.026 --> 00:04:00.047
"Well, good night, girls!"

87
00:04:00.567 --> 00:04:01.228
Fran said.

88
00:04:01.888 --> 00:04:03.949
Rachel, Mandy, and Jin stared at her.

89
00:04:03.969 --> 00:04:07.670
"Fran! We're going to stay up all night!"

90
00:04:08.231 --> 00:04:08.871
Mandy said.

91
00:04:08.891 --> 00:04:13.913
"But we already did everything," Fran complained.

92
00:04:13.933 --> 00:04:18.995
"We still haven't done the most exciting part of a slumber party."

93
00:04:19.496 --> 00:04:20.336
Rachel smiled.

94
00:04:21.644 --> 00:04:23.105
"Ghost stories!"

95
00:04:23.865 --> 00:04:24.765
everyone screamed.

96
00:04:25.446 --> 00:04:26.386
Jin went first.

97
00:04:26.806 --> 00:04:30.928
She told them a scary story about a woman who was murdered by her husband.

98
00:04:30.948 --> 00:04:36.490
"People say they can still see her ghost searching for her husband."

99
00:04:36.510 --> 00:04:39.591
"Now it's my turn," Rachel said.

100
00:04:40.212 --> 00:04:43.013
Rachel's story was even scarier than Jin's.

101
00:04:43.693 --> 00:04:46.734
It was about a strange man who only killed girls.

102
00:04:48.315 --> 00:04:52.453
"The little girl thought she was safe, but she suddenly heard footsteps.

103
00:04:53.214 --> 00:04:55.055
No one ever saw that girl again."

104
00:04:55.075 --> 00:04:59.098
"What what did he look like?"

105
00:04:59.558 --> 00:05:00.359
Mandy whispered.

106
00:05:00.979 --> 00:05:04.982
"They say he wore a long cloak and had spiky hair."

107
00:05:05.602 --> 00:05:06.863
Rachel pulled her hair up.

108
00:05:07.684 --> 00:05:10.626
"That was so scary!"

109
00:05:11.186 --> 00:05:11.927
Fran shivered.

110
00:05:11.947 --> 00:05:15.989
"Let's take a break and have some cake," Jin suggested.

111
00:05:17.650 --> 00:05:19.732
They all went down to the kitchen in the dark.

112
00:05:20.356 --> 00:05:23.118
"Don't turn the lights on," Jin whispered.

113
00:05:23.698 --> 00:05:27.740
"Ouch! I can't see anything," complained Mandy.

114
00:05:28.520 --> 00:05:30.521
"Shh! You'll wake everyone up!"

115
00:05:31.062 --> 00:05:32.703
Rachel covered Mandy's mouth.

116
00:05:32.723 --> 00:05:37.845
"I got the cake," Jin said quietly after they reached the kitchen.

117
00:05:38.466 --> 00:05:41.487
The girls tiptoed quietly back toward Jin's room.

118
00:05:41.507 --> 00:05:43.608
"What was that?"

119
00:05:44.229 --> 00:05:44.989
whispered Rachel.

120
00:05:45.009 --> 00:05:46.390
"It's not me!"

121
00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:47.611
Mandy said.

122
00:05:48.191 --> 00:05:50.012
They saw a strange shadow approaching.

123
00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:54.342
"Oh oh l-look!"

124
00:05:55.042 --> 00:05:55.783
Fran pointed.

125
00:05:55.803 --> 00:05:57.184
"It's him!

126
00:05:57.844 --> 00:05:59.125
He's here!"

127
00:05:59.586 --> 00:06:00.827
Rachel's voice quivered.

128
00:06:01.467 --> 00:06:05.430
The girls screamed as loud as they could, and Jin threw the cake in the air.

129
00:06:05.991 --> 00:06:08.753
When they heard the noise, Jin's parents came running.

130
00:06:09.454 --> 00:06:11.956
"What's going on here?"

131
00:06:12.416 --> 00:06:13.497
shouted Jin's father.

132
00:06:14.157 --> 00:06:16.880
The four friends were crying and holding onto each other.

133
00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:18.621
"He's here!

134
00:06:18.641 --> 00:06:20.843
He's going to kill us!"

135
00:06:21.503 --> 00:06:22.164
cried Fran.

136
00:06:22.844 --> 00:06:25.965
"There's nobody here," Jin's mother said.

137
00:06:26.606 --> 00:06:29.127
The girls stopped crying and opened their eyes.

138
00:06:29.147 --> 00:06:35.069
"But we all saw him," Mandy wiped some cream from the cake away from her eyes.

139
00:06:35.689 --> 00:06:36.890
The friends looked puzzled.

140
00:06:38.791 --> 00:06:41.231
Suddenly there was a sound from behind the door.

141
00:06:41.712 --> 00:06:42.432
It was Min.

142
00:06:42.452 --> 00:06:44.753
"Is this who you saw?"

143
00:06:45.233 --> 00:06:46.354
smiled Jin's mother.

144
00:06:46.374 --> 00:06:49.255
"Min!" screamed the girls.

145
00:06:49.915 --> 00:06:53.164
"This time it wasn't your brother's fault," Father said.

146
00:06:53.764 --> 00:06:55.445
Min had woken up and was thirsty.

147
00:06:56.025 --> 00:06:58.686
He had gone to the kitchen to get a glass of water.

148
00:06:58.706 --> 00:07:02.267
"I hope you learned a lesson," Mother said.

149
00:07:04.247 --> 00:07:07.068
The girls giggled and soon everyone was laughing.

150
00:07:07.088 --> 00:07:11.809
"Thank you for everything," Jin said to her parents the next evening.

151
00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:13.910
"Did everyone have a good time?"

152
00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:14.930
asked Mother.

153
00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:16.131
"Oh yes!

154
00:07:16.531 --> 00:07:18.451
It was the best slumber party ever!"

155
00:07:19.152 --> 00:07:20.552
Jin smiled at everyone.

156
00:07:21.221 --> 00:07:23.950
"Good. Next week we're having another one!"

157
00:07:24.592 --> 00:07:25.194
Mother said.

158
00:07:25.214 --> 00:07:27.782
"This time it's Min's turn."
